"pid-950101843"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 16, 2012 at 12:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4535110819790559653</id><published>2012-06-16T11:33:51.981-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-16T11:33:51.981-06:00</updated><title type='text'>My mother has been a nurse for 34 years and she sa...</title><content type='html'>My mother has been a nurse for 34 years and she said the same thing. She would have never gone through with any of that unless she had a direct order from a judge. Even then, she&amp;#39;d have her doubts. Everyone is to blame here but the victims. They did nothing. Our system is compromised, this country is dying.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6070715109932218987/comments/default/4535110819790559653'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6070715109932218987/comments/default/4535110819790559653'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/judicially-authorized-rape-newest.html?showComment=1339868031981#c4535110819790559653' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6070715109932218987/comments/default/5312696111020551110'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/judicially-authorized-rape-newest.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6070715109932218987' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6070715109932218987' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824886302"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 1