simply a gang of hired thugs being paid by your tax dollars to oppress you and protect the rich. We need to get rid of every last one of these useless bastards, one way or another, and it needs to be done ASAP.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6070715109932218987/comments/default/3720593255444880352'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6070715109932218987/comments/default/3720593255444880352'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/judicially-authorized-rape-newest.html?showComment=1339853859310#c3720593255444880352' title=''/><author><name>Jolly Roger</name><uri>http://jollyrogerrevolution.blogspot.com/</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/06/judicially-authorized-rape-newest.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6070715109932218987' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6070715109932218987' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1227099272"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 16, 2012 at 7:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5053230065293146210</id><published>2012-06-16T03:42:28.603-06:00</published><updated>2012-06-16T03:42:28.603-06:00</updated><title type='text'>And so the long train of abuse continues.</title><content type='html'>And so the long train of abuse continues.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6070715109932218987/comments/default/5053230065293146210'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/607071